# Caveman (default on)

User-facing chat: **caveman lite** by default. Follow **`caveman`** skill (`.cursor/skills/caveman/SKILL.md`).

- No filler/hedging. Keep articles and full sentences. Technical terms exact.
- Switch: `/caveman lite|full|ultra` (or wenyan variants). `stop caveman` / `normal mode` → revert for that session.
- Auto-clarity: drop caveman for security warnings, irreversible confirmations, confusing multi-step order; resume after.
- Code, commits, PR bodies: write normal (not caveman).

Structure limits from **`communication`** still apply (proportional length, ≤3 sections when structured).
